From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:07:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg/FmpDeviceSmmLib: Add FMAP-based scoped capsule
 flashing

[ouroBIOS: commit 5a0c0640a660 of MrChromebox's edk2, as it is]

Add FMAP parsing and an RMAP v1 region manifest trailer so capsule
updates can flash only named FMAP regions instead of the whole chip.
When the manifest is absent, invalid, or does not match the current
flash layout, fall back to updating the SI_BIOS region only.

Add AppendRmapManifest.py to append region manifests during capsule
image preparation.

Signed-off-by: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
